    "long_instructions": "## Flowchart Chatbot\r\n\r\nUse this chatbot to help plan your app's logic.\r\n\r\nIt can help you:\r\n- identify the steps your app should follow\r\n- define conditions and decision points\r\n- think through how user inputs lead to different outcomes\r\n- determine what values your app needs to track\r\n\r\nUse your wireframe and project idea to guide your thinking.\r\n\r\nCome away with a clear plan for how your app should behave.",
